      <h3><span class="lang-en">Config</span><span class="lang-de">Konfiguration</span></h3>
      <p><span class="lang-en">Edit <code>~/.config/notectl/notectl.yaml</code>:</span><span class="lang-de">Bearbeite <code>~/.config/notectl/notectl.yaml</code>:</span></p>
      <pre><code>{`vault_path: ~/Documents/Obsidian/MyVault
source: obsidian   # obsidian | apple | markdown | joplin`}</code></pre>
      <p><span class="lang-en">For Joplin: enable <em>Options → Web Clipper</em> in Joplin, then set <code>joplin_token</code> to the token shown there.</span><span class="lang-de">Für Joplin: <em>Optionen → Web-Clipper</em> in Joplin aktivieren, dann <code>joplin_token</code> auf den dort angezeigten Token setzen.</span></p>
